            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "34-5. REPORT OF ABSENCE—A teacher who is absent from duty because of personal illness, death in the family, quarantine, or compliance with the requirements of a court shall notify the principal as early as possible, and such notification shall be given in advance where possible. A teacher who is absent from duty for any other reason shall first secure permission from the Superintendent of Schools through the principal.",
